# ===============================
# 🦀 Rust/Leptos/WASM Artifacts
# ===============================
**/target/
**/target_authenc/
**/pkg/
**/dist/
**/output/
**/site/
**/wasm32-unknown-unknown/
**/*.wasm
**/*.js
**/*.d.ts
# …but the `**/*.js` above is about wasm-bindgen output, not test code. The
# visual-sweep harness sits in the e2e directory and must be tracked: kept out
# of the repo it gets re-derived from scratch each session, and on 2026-08-29
# a re-derivation got the route nesting wrong and photographed the 404 page 24
# times while reporting full coverage.
!antarmuka/*/tests/e2e/_*.js
# Cargo.lock policy:
# - Binary / application crate (workspace ini): WAJIB tracked untuk reproducible build.
# - Library-only crate: skip (tapi tidak applicable di sini, semua workspace member jadi binary).
# Pattern di bawah hanya skip Cargo.lock di sub-project frontend yang punya
# Cargo.toml terpisah (mis. trunk dist build artifacts), bukan workspace member.
# **/Cargo.lock  # <-- DIHAPUS: bug menyebabkan Docker build fail di release.yml.

# Microfrontend auto-generated
antarmuka/*/target/
antarmuka/*/pkg/
antarmuka/*/dist/
antarmuka/*/output/
antarmuka/*/site/
antarmuka/*/wasm32-unknown-unknown/
antarmuka/*/*.wasm
antarmuka/*/*.js
antarmuka/*/*.d.ts
antarmuka/*/Cargo.lock

# WASM-specific cache directories
**/.wasm-bindgen/
**/wasm-bindgen-*/
**/.trunk/
**/trunk-cache/

# Leptos development artifacts
**/leptos_*
**/*.autogen.rs
**/*.generated.*

# Trunk build system
**/Trunk.lock
# Enhanced Build System
.build_cache/
.metrics/
.dev_servers/
/tmp/trunk_*.pid
/tmp/dev_servers.txt
/tmp/proxy_*.conf

# ===============================
# 🎯 Performance & Monitoring
# ===============================
# Large build artifacts
**/*.debug
**/*.symbols
**/debug/deps/
**/release/deps/

# Performance profiling
**/perf.data*
**/flame.svg
**/profile.*

# Size analysis
**/size-report.*
**/bundle-analysis.*

# ===============================
# Cargo Chef auto-generated
recipe.json
!**/tailwind.config.js
# Tracked JS configuration files in monolith Laravel. Tanpa un-ignore
# ini, `.gitignore:156 **/*.js` membuat vite.config.js (entry point
# Vite build) terabaikan dan CI Vite job gagal dengan
# "Cannot resolve entry module index.html" karena fresh checkout tidak
# punya config dan Vite fallback ke entry default.
!**/vite.config.js
!**/postcss.config.js
# Laravel source assets (resources/js/*.js) di-track sebagai source code.
# Tanpa exception, `**/*.js` membuat `monolith/simpelv1/resources/js/
# app.js` + `bootstrap.js` (entry point Vite) tidak ada di fresh
# checkout, dan Vite build gagal "Cannot resolve entry module
# resources/js/app.js".
!monolith/simpelv1/resources/js/**/*.js
!**/profile.rs
.env

# Local AI assistant artifacts (keep local settings out of VCS, but
# share team Skills — see F0-D). `.claude/*` (not `.claude/`) so a child
# dir can be re-included; a fully-ignored dir cannot.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
